  - m_Id: 507117578
    m_Localized: Classroom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117579
    m_Localized: Lab
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117580
    m_Localized: Library
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117581
    m_Localized: Bus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117582
    m_Localized: Canteen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117583
    m_Localized: Campaign won! The school is thriving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117584
    m_Localized: Campaign lost. The school could not meet its goals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117585
    m_Localized: A teacher is absent today. Pay for cover, or let classes suffer?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117586
    m_Localized: A parent has filed a complaint. Respond now, or let it go?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117587
    m_Localized: Choose a lot off the main path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117588
    m_Localized: That lot is already occupied.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117589
    m_Localized: Not enough cash to build this facility.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117590
    m_Localized: Tuition is outside the allowed range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117591
    m_Localized: There is no incident awaiting a decision.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117592
    m_Localized: Not enough cash to intervene.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117593
    m_Localized: The campaign has ended.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117594
    m_Localized: Resolve the incident first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117595
    m_Localized: You have reached the limit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 507117596
    m_Localized: No employee holds this role.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885393432576
    m_Localized: Al Noor Private School
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124352
    m_Localized: Week {week} of {total}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 198885473124353
    m_Localized: '{cash} QAR'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 198885473124354
    m_Localized: '{students} students'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 198885473124355
    m_Localized: Next Week
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124356
    m_Localized: Start a New Year
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124357
    m_Localized: Your decision
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124358
    m_Localized: Week {week}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 198885473124359
    m_Localized: Before the bell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124360
    m_Localized: '{value} {name}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 198885473124361
    m_Localized: QAR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124362
    m_Localized: Students
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124363
    m_Localized: Reputation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124364
    m_Localized: Parents
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124365
    m_Localized: Staff
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124366
    m_Localized: Academics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124367
    m_Localized: The year is done
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124368
    m_Localized: Bankrupt
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124369
    m_Localized: The board fired you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124370
    m_Localized: The staff walked out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124371
    m_Localized: The last bell rang on {students} students and a school still standing,
      which some weeks felt unlikely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 198885473124372
    m_Localized: The salary account hit zero in week {week}. The sign outside is
      already for rent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 198885473124373
    m_Localized: In week {week} the board thanked you for your service and asked
      for your keys.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 198885473124374
    m_Localized: In week {week} you arrived to find empty classrooms and a very short
      letter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 198885473124375
    m_Localized: 'Final grade: {grade}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 198885473124376
    m_Localized: Decide the current event first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124377
    m_Localized: There is no event waiting for a decision.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124378
    m_Localized: That choice is not available.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124379
    m_Localized: You have the keys, 120 students and one very nervous accountant.
      Good luck, Director.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124380
    m_Localized: The week brought tuition, payroll and a knock on your door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124381
    m_Localized: A quiet week. You finally drank a coffee while it was hot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124382
    m_Localized: Nothing caught fire. You count this as a victory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124383
    m_Localized: The photocopier jammed twice. Otherwise, peace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124384
    m_Localized: Grade 3 sang in assembly. Most of them, in the same key.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124385
    m_Localized: A parent emailed to say thank you. You printed it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124386
    m_Localized: The week passed with only minor arguments about parking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124387
    m_Localized: A wealthy father slides an envelope across your desk and asks you
      to fix his son's maths mark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124388
    m_Localized: Hand back the envelope
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124389
    m_Localized: He left furious. The maths department bought you cake.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124390
    m_Localized: Change the mark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124391
    m_Localized: The envelope paid for new chairs. Nobody asked questions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124392
    m_Localized: The maths teacher took the marksheets to the board. It was a long
      meeting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124393
    m_Localized: Your best physics teacher has an offer from a rival school, with
      a bigger salary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124394
    m_Localized: Match the salary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124395
    m_Localized: She stayed, and told everyone why.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124396
    m_Localized: Promise a raise next year
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124397
    m_Localized: She stayed for now. She has a calendar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124398
    m_Localized: Wish her well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124399
    m_Localized: You saved her salary. Physics results may not recover.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124400
    m_Localized: The Grade 10 chemistry paper is circulating in a student group chat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124401
    m_Localized: Rewrite it and retake
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124402
    m_Localized: Parents groaned, but the results meant something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124403
    m_Localized: Say nothing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124404
    m_Localized: The marks looked wonderful. Nobody said a word.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124405
    m_Localized: A parent posted the screenshots. The word 'scandal' was used.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124406
    m_Localized: Find the source quietly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124407
    m_Localized: You traced it to one phone and one apologetic prefect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124408
    m_Localized: A ministry inspector will arrive on Thursday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124409
    m_Localized: Change nothing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124410
    m_Localized: She praised how honestly the school runs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124411
    m_Localized: She found the fire door you meant to fix.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124412
    m_Localized: Prepare all week
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124413
    m_Localized: Every file shone. So did the shadows under your teachers' eyes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124414
    m_Localized: Ask to postpone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124415
    m_Localized: She agreed, and you all exhaled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124416
    m_Localized: She came anyway, and brought a colleague.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124417
    m_Localized: The air conditioning has died in the east wing. It is 43 degrees
      outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124418
    m_Localized: Replace the unit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124419
    m_Localized: Cold air returned. Grade 7 cheered as if for a goal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124420
    m_Localized: Patch it for now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124421
    m_Localized: It works, with a noise like a distant camel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124422
    m_Localized: Wait for cooler weather
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124423
    m_Localized: The heat broke early. You got lucky.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124424
    m_Localized: Two students fainted and four families left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124425
    m_Localized: The morning bus has been late five days running, and the parents'
      group has noticed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124426
    m_Localized: Redraw the route
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124427
    m_Localized: The bus is on time. Parents have moved on to complaining about lunch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124428
    m_Localized: Send an apology
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124429
    m_Localized: Your apology was read. The bus was still late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124430
    m_Localized: Add a second driver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124431
    m_Localized: Two drivers and no more delays.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124432
    m_Localized: A family has not paid in three months. The father lost his job.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124433
    m_Localized: Cover it with a bursary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124434
    m_Localized: The mother cried in your office. Word got around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124435
    m_Localized: Offer instalments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124436
    m_Localized: A fair plan, and the first payment arrived.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124437
    m_Localized: Remove the student
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124438
    m_Localized: The balance sheet improved. The staff room went very quiet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124439
    m_Localized: A businessman offers a large gift, if the school is renamed after
      him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124440
    m_Localized: Rename the school
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124441
    m_Localized: The money is real, and so is the new sign nobody likes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124442
    m_Localized: Offer a hall plaque
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124443
    m_Localized: He settled for a plaque and a smaller cheque.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124444
    m_Localized: Decline politely
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124445
    m_Localized: The staff were proud. The accountant lay down for a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124446
    m_Localized: A video of older boys tormenting a younger student is being shared.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124447
    m_Localized: Suspend those involved
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124448
    m_Localized: A clear line was drawn, and one family left over it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124449
    m_Localized: Bring the families together
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124450
    m_Localized: Hard words, then real apologies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124451
    m_Localized: The meeting ended with threats and a second video.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124452
    m_Localized: Hire a counsellor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124453
    m_Localized: The school has somewhere safe to send children now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124454
    m_Localized: Ramadan is coming. Parents and teachers want a shorter day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124455
    m_Localized: Shorten the day
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124456
    m_Localized: Everyone is grateful. The syllabus is a little behind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124457
    m_Localized: Keep normal hours
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124458
    m_Localized: Lessons ran on time, through a great deal of yawning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124459
    m_Localized: Pay for a flexible timetable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124460
    m_Localized: A clever timetable kept nearly everybody happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124461
    m_Localized: National Day is near. Grade 6 has already made too many flags.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124462
    m_Localized: Hold a grand celebration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124463
    m_Localized: Parents filmed everything. The school looked magnificent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124464
    m_Localized: A modest assembly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124465
    m_Localized: Short, warm and on budget.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124466
    m_Localized: Keep teaching
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124467
    m_Localized: A surprising number of people noticed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124468
    m_Localized: The science teachers want to host a fair for local schools.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124469
    m_Localized: Fund it properly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124470
    m_Localized: A Grade 9 water filter made the local news.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124471
    m_Localized: Keep it in-house
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124472
    m_Localized: Volcanoes erupted on schedule.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124473
    m_Localized: Cancel it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124474
    m_Localized: The budget held. The science staff did not smile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124475
    m_Localized: Two senior teachers are no longer speaking, and everyone has chosen
      a side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124476
    m_Localized: Hear them both out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124477
    m_Localized: It took an afternoon and a box of tissues. It worked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124478
    m_Localized: Order them to stop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124479
    m_Localized: They stopped talking about it, and resent you instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124480
    m_Localized: Rearrange departments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124481
    m_Localized: Separate corridors solved what words could not.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124482
    m_Localized: A mother with 200,000 followers has posted about your school's uniform
      prices.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124483
    m_Localized: Invite her for coffee
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124484
    m_Localized: Her next post called you 'surprisingly reasonable'.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124485
    m_Localized: Publish a statement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124486
    m_Localized: It was accurate and nobody read it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124487
    m_Localized: Have a lawyer write
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124488
    m_Localized: She deleted the post without a word.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124489
    m_Localized: She posted the letter. It got more views than the first one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124490
    m_Localized: A small fire in the chemistry lab singed a bench and frightened
      Grade 8.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124491
    m_Localized: Close it for a full audit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124492
    m_Localized: New equipment, new rules and no practicals for weeks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124493
    m_Localized: Run safety training
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124494
    m_Localized: Everyone now knows where the blanket is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124495
    m_Localized: Carry on as normal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124496
    m_Localized: It was a one-off, and practicals went on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124497
    m_Localized: It was not a one-off. An ambulance came.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124498
    m_Localized: A new international school is offering discounts to your families.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124499
    m_Localized: Launch scholarships
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124500
    m_Localized: Three bright students joined, and the newspapers noticed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124501
    m_Localized: Hold an open day
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124502
    m_Localized: Families saw what they would be leaving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124503
    m_Localized: Do nothing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124504
    m_Localized: Five desks are empty on Sunday morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124505
    m_Localized: A nutritionist parent has photographed everything sold in your canteen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124506
    m_Localized: Change the menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124507
    m_Localized: Fruit now outsells chips, by a slim margin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124508
    m_Localized: Ask the vendor to improve
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124509
    m_Localized: He added one apple to the display.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124510
    m_Localized: Bring in a new vendor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124511
    m_Localized: Better food, and a very upset former vendor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124512
    m_Localized: The chairman's son was caught cheating in a major exam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124513
    m_Localized: Give him a zero
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124514
    m_Localized: The chairman stopped greeting you. The teachers started.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124515
    m_Localized: Give a quiet warning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124516
    m_Localized: He sat the paper again. The staff noticed who gets second chances.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124517
    m_Localized: Make it disappear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124518
    m_Localized: The chairman was very grateful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124519
    m_Localized: The invigilator resigned and explained why, in writing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124520
    m_Localized: Three teachers have asked for sick leave in the same week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124521
    m_Localized: Hire relief staff
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124522
    m_Localized: Help arrived and shoulders dropped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124523
    m_Localized: Give everyone a day off
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124524
    m_Localized: A deep breath, and a lost day of lessons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124525
    m_Localized: Remind them of their contracts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124526
    m_Localized: They came back and stopped staying late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124527
    m_Localized: Two students could compete at the national maths olympiad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124528
    m_Localized: Pay for a coach
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124529
    m_Localized: They returned with bronze and a lot of confidence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124530
    m_Localized: Send them as they are
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124531
    m_Localized: They took silver. You did nothing and accepted all the credit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124532
    m_Localized: They came last, but kindly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124533
    m_Localized: Skip it this year
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124534
    m_Localized: The students were quiet about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124535
    m_Localized: A heavy sandstorm is forecast for tomorrow morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124536
    m_Localized: Close the school
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124537
    m_Localized: Everybody stayed safe at home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124538
    m_Localized: Teach online
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124539
    m_Localized: The lesson went ahead, with several cats.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124540
    m_Localized: Stay open
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124541
    m_Localized: The storm passed north, and you looked decisive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124542
    m_Localized: Buses crawled through it. Parents were furious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124543
    m_Localized: Parents are divided about how much of the day should be taught in
      Arabic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124544
    m_Localized: Strengthen Arabic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124545
    m_Localized: Grandparents everywhere approved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124546
    m_Localized: Keep the balance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124547
    m_Localized: A committee will continue to discuss it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124548
    m_Localized: Move further to English
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124549
    m_Localized: A cheaper timetable and some very sharp emails.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124550
    m_Localized: A salesman offers a tablet for every student, payable now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124551
    m_Localized: Buy them all
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124552
    m_Localized: Lessons changed, and so did the IT teacher's sleep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124553
    m_Localized: Pilot with one grade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124554
    m_Localized: A careful trial with good results.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124555
    m_Localized: Stick with books
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124556
    m_Localized: Paper has never needed a software update.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124557
    m_Localized: A former student, now a surgeon, wants to visit her old school.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124558
    m_Localized: Hold a welcome assembly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124559
    m_Localized: She remembered her Grade 4 teacher's name. Nobody's eyes stayed
      dry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124560
    m_Localized: Ask her for a donation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124561
    m_Localized: She wrote a generous cheque on the spot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124562
    m_Localized: She left early, and rather politely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124563
    m_Localized: Say you are too busy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124564
    m_Localized: She sent a kind note anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124565
    m_Localized: A banking error means salaries will be late this month.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124566
    m_Localized: Take a short bridging loan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124567
    m_Localized: Everyone was paid on time and never knew.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124568
    m_Localized: Explain and apologise
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124569
    m_Localized: They understood. Rent collectors did not.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124570
    m_Localized: Cancel the Grade 8 trip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124571
    m_Localized: Salaries were paid. Grade 8 will remember this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124572
    m_Localized: A family asks if your school can support their son, who uses a wheelchair.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124573
    m_Localized: Rebuild for access
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124574
    m_Localized: Ramps went in. He is now the loudest boy in Grade 5.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124575
    m_Localized: Make what changes you can
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124576
    m_Localized: He joined, with some awkward routes around the building.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124577
    m_Localized: Say you cannot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124578
    m_Localized: The family told their story to anyone who asked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124579
    m_Localized: The school team has reached the league final.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124580
    m_Localized: Bus everyone to the match
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124581
    m_Localized: They lost on penalties. It was the best day of the year.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124582
    m_Localized: Wish them luck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124583
    m_Localized: Polite applause from the staff room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124584
    m_Localized: Exams come first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124585
    m_Localized: Marks rose. So did the resentment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124586
    m_Localized: Rare rain has found every crack in the old classroom roof.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124587
    m_Localized: Replace the roof
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124588
    m_Localized: Expensive, dry and finally finished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124589
    m_Localized: Hire the cheapest contractor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124590
    m_Localized: It held. You are as surprised as anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124591
    m_Localized: It leaked again, onto the new projector.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124592
    m_Localized: Move the classes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124593
    m_Localized: Grade 5 now studies in the library, loudly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124594
    m_Localized: The parents' group chat has decided you are hiding something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124595
    m_Localized: Join the group
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124596
    m_Localized: You now receive 400 messages a day, and they trust you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124597
    m_Localized: Start a weekly newsletter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124598
    m_Localized: Facts have begun to compete with rumours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124599
    m_Localized: Forbid staff from replying
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124600
    m_Localized: The group noticed, and added it to the list.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124601
    m_Localized: Final exams are close and Grade 12 looks unready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124602
    m_Localized: Fund extra revision
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124603
    m_Localized: Teachers are exhausted. Grade 12 is not lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124604
    m_Localized: Trust the teaching
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124605
    m_Localized: They will get what they have earned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124606
    m_Localized: Make the papers easier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124607
    m_Localized: Everyone went home happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198885473124608
    m_Localized: External moderators asked to see the papers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 203355108016128
    m_Localized: "\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064A\u0629"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896635609088
    m_Localized: Day {day} of {total}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 358896723689472
    m_Localized: Day {day}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 358896723689473
    m_Localized: Your school starts here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896727883776
    m_Localized: You have {cash} QAR, a lot of nerve and no building. Rent one and
      decide how it will run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 358896727883777
    m_Localized: Sign the lease and open
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896727883778
    m_Localized: The old villa
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896727883779
    m_Localized: '{capacity} seats, {rent} QAR a week. No gym.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 358896732078080
    m_Localized: Neighbourhood campus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078081
    m_Localized: '{capacity} seats, {rent} QAR a week. Gym included.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 358896732078082
    m_Localized: The grand academy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078083
    m_Localized: '{capacity} seats, {rent} QAR a week. Gym included.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 358896732078084
    m_Localized: Student seats
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078085
    m_Localized: Weekly fee
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078086
    m_Localized: Teachers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078087
    m_Localized: Administrators
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078088
    m_Localized: First bell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078089
    m_Localized: Lessons a day
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078090
    m_Localized: 'Cost to open: {opening} QAR

      Expected: {students} students

      Every
      week: +{income} fees, -{bill} bills'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 358896732078091
    m_Localized: 'Expected: {students} students

      Every week: +{income} fees,
      -{bill} bills'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 358896732078092
    m_Localized: School settings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078093
    m_Localized: Apply from tomorrow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078094
    m_Localized: Leave as it is
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078095
    m_Localized: Lesson {period} of {total}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 358896732078096
    m_Localized: Break time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078097
    m_Localized: The last bell has rung
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078098
    m_Localized: '{minutes} min left'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 358896732078099
    m_Localized: Skip to the last bell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078100
    m_Localized: Pause
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078101
    m_Localized: 1x
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078102
    m_Localized: 2x
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078103
    m_Localized: 4x
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078104
    m_Localized: The building is empty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078105
    m_Localized: The lights are still yours until morning. What happens here tonight?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078106
    m_Localized: Change school settings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078107
    m_Localized: Open for private lessons, about {cash} QAR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 358896732078108
    m_Localized: Classrooms stayed lit past sunset. Tired teachers, full envelopes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078109
    m_Localized: Rent the gym to a club tonight, {cash} QAR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 358896732078110
    m_Localized: A club played until ten and left the floor cleaner than they found
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078111
    m_Localized: A club paid for the night and broke a basketball hoop. The repair
      cost more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078112
    m_Localized: Sign a season contract with the club, {cash} QAR a night
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 358896732078113
    m_Localized: You shook hands with the club. The gym now pays you every night,
      even when you are not looking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078114
    m_Localized: Host a parents evening
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078115
    m_Localized: Tea, dates and one long speech about parking. Parents left feeling
      heard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078116
    m_Localized: Lock up and send everyone home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078117
    m_Localized: You turned off the last light. Your staff will thank you tomorrow,
      silently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078118
    m_Localized: The lease is signed and the sign is up. Parents are lining up at
      the gate. Good luck, Director.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078119
    m_Localized: Payday. The fees came in, the rent and the salaries went out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078120
    m_Localized: You rewrote the plan after hours. It starts tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078121
    m_Localized: A quiet day. You finally drank a coffee while it was hot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078122
    m_Localized: Nothing caught fire. You count this as a victory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078123
    m_Localized: The photocopier jammed twice. Otherwise, peace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078124
    m_Localized: Grade 3 sang in assembly. Most of them, in the same key.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078125
    m_Localized: A parent wrote to say thank you. You printed it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078126
    m_Localized: The only argument today was about parking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078127
    m_Localized: Someone drew you on the board. It was flattering, mostly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078128
    m_Localized: The canteen ran out of samosas by ten. Morale held, barely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078129
    m_Localized: Morning letter. Day {streak} in a row
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 358896732078130
    m_Localized: +{cash} QAR left on your desk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 358896732078131
    m_Localized: The club paid {cash} QAR while you were away
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 358896732078132
    m_Localized: Fold it and start the day
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078133
    m_Localized: Tomorrow morning, another envelope.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078134
    m_Localized: 'Ms. Huda writes: Salem in Grade 4 has not said one word in class
      since September. He answers on paper, in very neat handwriting.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078135
    m_Localized: 'The accountant writes: Noura in Grade 9 has the highest maths mark
      we have ever recorded. Her fees are also two months late.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078136
    m_Localized: 'A note in old-fashioned ink: Director, I have taught Arabic in
      this city for forty-one years. This is probably my last year. Yousef.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078137
    m_Localized: 'Ms. Huda writes: Salem left a poem about his grandfather on my
      desk. It is good. It is really good. He asked me not to tell anyone.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078138
    m_Localized: 'A note from the gate guard: Noura waits for the last bus and does
      her homework under the lamp. She says her father is between jobs.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078139
    m_Localized: The staff room reports that Mr. Yousef remembers the name of every
      student he ever taught. He has started writing them down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078140
    m_Localized: 'Ms. Huda writes: The poetry assembly is next week. Should I ask
      Salem to read in front of the school?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078141
    m_Localized: Ask him. He can do this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078142
    m_Localized: Do not push him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078143
    m_Localized: You told Ms. Huda to ask him. Salem went pale, then nodded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078144
    m_Localized: You told Ms. Huda to let him be. She read his poem herself, without
      his name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078145
    m_Localized: 'The accountant writes: Noura''s fees are now three months late.
      Policy says she leaves. A scholarship would cost us.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078146
    m_Localized: Give her a full scholarship.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078147
    m_Localized: Offer instalments only.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078148
    m_Localized: You signed the scholarship and asked that nobody tell her who decided.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078149
    m_Localized: You offered instalments. Her father came in person and thanked you,
      looking at the floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078150
    m_Localized: 'Mr. Yousef writes: My eyes are failing. I can stay on with a reduced
      timetable, if the school can carry the cost. Or I can go quietly.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078151
    m_Localized: Stay as long as you want.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078152
    m_Localized: Let us give you a farewell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078153
    m_Localized: You told him the chair by the window is his for as long as he wants
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078154
    m_Localized: You planned his farewell. The students are already making a very
      large card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078155
    m_Localized: 'A folded page on your desk, in very neat handwriting: Thank you
      for the school. I like it here. Salem.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078156
    m_Localized: 'The maths department writes: Noura has been helping younger students
      at break. She says she is paying something back.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078157
    m_Localized: The list is finished. Mr. Yousef's notebook has eleven thousand
      names in it. He left it open on your desk for one day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078158
    m_Localized: He stood up. His voice shook for one line, and then it did not.
      Two hundred people heard Salem for the first time, and his mother cried in
      the second row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078159
    m_Localized: 'Salem''s poem won the city prize under his own name. He came to
      your office, stood very straight, and said two words out loud: thank you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078160
    m_Localized: 'Noura won a place at the national olympiad. On the form, under
      who helped you most, she wrote: someone at my school. I never found out who.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078161
    m_Localized: Noura's family paid the last instalment in coins and notes. She
      asked for the receipt herself, and she kept it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078162
    m_Localized: Mr. Yousef taught his last lesson today, sitting down, with the
      door open so the corridor could hear. Nobody walked past.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078163
    m_Localized: Four generations of one family came to Mr. Yousef's farewell. He
      greeted each of them by name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078164
    m_Localized: A child left an orange on your desk. There was no note. It was a
      very good orange.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078165
    m_Localized: The cleaner says the school smells better than it did. You have
      decided to accept this as a compliment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078166
    m_Localized: Someone in Grade 2 wants to be a director when they grow up. They
      have asked what you actually do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078167
    m_Localized: A former student stopped at the gate this morning just to look in,
      and waved at nobody in particular.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078168
    m_Localized: The neem tree by the gate has flowered. Three teachers have told
      you, separately, as if it were news.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078169
    m_Localized: There is not enough money for this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078170
    m_Localized: That plan is not valid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078171
    m_Localized: That cannot be done right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078172
    m_Localized: That activity is not available tonight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078173
    m_Localized: There is no letter today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358896732078174
    m_Localized: Read the morning letter first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264794963968
    m_Localized: Very fast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627264
    m_Localized: Ahmed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627265
    m_Localized: Maryam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627266
    m_Localized: Khalid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627267
    m_Localized: Fatima
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627268
    m_Localized: Hamad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627269
    m_Localized: Aisha
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627270
    m_Localized: Jassim
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627271
    m_Localized: Latifa
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627272
    m_Localized: Abdulla
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627273
    m_Localized: Moza
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627274
    m_Localized: Saeed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627275
    m_Localized: Shaikha
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627276
    m_Localized: Faisal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627277
    m_Localized: Hessa
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627278
    m_Localized: Nasser
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627279
    m_Localized: Amna
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627280
    m_Localized: Mubarak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627281
    m_Localized: Sara
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627282
    m_Localized: Rashid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627283
    m_Localized: Dana
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627284
    m_Localized: Ali
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627285
    m_Localized: Reem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627286
    m_Localized: Sultan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627287
    m_Localized: Noof
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627288
    m_Localized: Arabic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627289
    m_Localized: English
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627290
    m_Localized: Maths
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627291
    m_Localized: Science
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627292
    m_Localized: Islamic studies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627293
    m_Localized: Social studies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627294
    m_Localized: Computing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627295
    m_Localized: Sports
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627296
    m_Localized: Punctual
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627297
    m_Localized: Always in the room before the bell. The bell has started to feel
      judged.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627298
    m_Localized: Often late
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627299
    m_Localized: Blames the traffic, even on days with no traffic. Some lessons start
      without a teacher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627300
    m_Localized: Patient
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627301
    m_Localized: Will explain fractions a ninth time in the same calm voice as the
      first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627302
    m_Localized: Strict
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627303
    m_Localized: Silent classrooms, straight rows and the occasional complaint from
      home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627304
    m_Localized: Creative
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627305
    m_Localized: Taught the water cycle with a kettle and a song. Now and then it
      lifts the whole school.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627306
    m_Localized: Ambitious
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627307
    m_Localized: Has already asked what your job pays. Learns fast and expects to
      be noticed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627308
    m_Localized: In eleven years I have never needed a bell to tell me where to be.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627309
    m_Localized: Three schools, all excellent. Sorry again about this morning, the
      roundabout was a disgrace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627310
    m_Localized: I once spent a whole term on one boy and long division. We got there
      in May.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627311
    m_Localized: My classes finish the syllabus early. Nobody has ever asked me why
      they are so quiet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627312
    m_Localized: I have taught in six rooms and rearranged the furniture in all of
      them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627313
    m_Localized: Four years as a teacher, one as head of department. I am early for
      the next step.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627314
    m_Localized: I am at the door when they arrive. It is difficult to be late to
      someone already waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627315
    m_Localized: Children settle down on their own, I find, if you give them ten
      minutes before you get there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627316
    m_Localized: I wait. Nobody can stay angry at a person who is simply waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627317
    m_Localized: One warning. I have rarely needed to explain what comes after it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627318
    m_Localized: The loudest child gets to run the experiment. Suddenly the loudest
      child wants silence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627319
    m_Localized: I keep records of everything. Results improve, and I can show you
      the graph.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627320
    m_Localized: A timetable that holds for one full week. I would frame it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627321
    m_Localized: A house next door to the school. Possibly inside the school.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627322
    m_Localized: To meet one of my old students who still remembers how to do fractions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627323
    m_Localized: An exam hall where nobody asks to borrow a ruler.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627324
    m_Localized: A classroom without walls. Failing that, one with a very large window.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627325
    m_Localized: Your chair, Director, in about five years. I mean that respectfully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264895627326
    m_Localized: A fight in the yard after break, with {name} in the middle of it.
      One torn shirt and three versions of events.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821568
    m_Localized: Suspend for a day
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821569
    m_Localized: Sit down and listen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821570
    m_Localized: Call the family in
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821571
    m_Localized: '{name} spent a day at home. The yard was quiet, and the shirt was
      not mentioned again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821572
    m_Localized: You heard {name} out over a cup of water. There turned out to be
      a fourth version of events.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821573
    m_Localized: The family of {name} arrived in force. Everyone apologised to everyone,
      at length.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821574
    m_Localized: A phone rang in the middle of a science test, and it belongs to
      {name}. The ringtone was, unfortunately, memorable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821575
    m_Localized: Confiscate it for a week
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821576
    m_Localized: Have a quiet word
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821577
    m_Localized: Hand it to the family
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821578
    m_Localized: The phone of {name} now lives in your drawer, where it receives
      many messages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821579
    m_Localized: A short talk with {name}, and the phone went back in the bag, on
      silent, for now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821580
    m_Localized: The phone went home by way of the family of {name}. Word is it stayed
      there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821581
    m_Localized: The maths teacher has two identical papers, down to the same wrong
      answer. One of them is by {name}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821582
    m_Localized: Zero on the paper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821583
    m_Localized: Ask for the truth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821584
    m_Localized: Inform the family
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821585
    m_Localized: '{name} received a zero, written very clearly. The other paper got
      the same.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821586
    m_Localized: It took a long silence, and then {name} told you everything. A retest
      was agreed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821587
    m_Localized: You showed both papers to the family of {name}. Nobody needed the
      mistake explained.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821588
    m_Localized: The register says {name} was absent. The guard saw someone very
      similar at the corner shop at ten, holding a karak.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821589
    m_Localized: Detention all week
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821590
    m_Localized: Ask what is going on
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821591
    m_Localized: Telephone home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821592
    m_Localized: '{name} spent the week in detention, and discovered that the library
      has a clock that ticks.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821593
    m_Localized: '{name} was avoiding one particular lesson. You now know which one,
      and why.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821594
    m_Localized: The phone call to the home of {name} was short. The next morning's
      arrival was very early.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821595
    m_Localized: '{name} answered a teacher back in front of the whole class, and
      the staff room is still discussing the wording.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821596
    m_Localized: Written apology and detention
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821597
    m_Localized: Talk it through
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821598
    m_Localized: Bring the family in
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821599
    m_Localized: '{name} wrote the apology in full. The grammar, the teacher noted,
      was excellent.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821600
    m_Localized: You asked {name} what had really happened that day. The answer had
      little to do with the teacher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821601
    m_Localized: The family of {name} sat in your office and agreed with the teacher,
      loudly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821602
    m_Localized: '{name} has been late four times in two weeks. The excuses have
      become quite inventive.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821603
    m_Localized: Stay after the last bell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821604
    m_Localized: Ask about mornings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821605
    m_Localized: Speak to the family
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821606
    m_Localized: '{name} now stays behind after school, making up each minute under
      the eye of the guard.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821607
    m_Localized: There are younger siblings to be walked to another school. You and
      {name} worked out a new start time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821608
    m_Localized: The family of {name} promised an alarm clock. Two were delivered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821609
    m_Localized: Someone carved a name into a new desk with a compass. The name is
      {name}, which at least saved time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821610
    m_Localized: Pay for the desk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821611
    m_Localized: Sand it down together
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821612
    m_Localized: Show the family the desk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821613
    m_Localized: '{name} paid for the desk from a month of pocket money, in instalments.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821614
    m_Localized: You and {name} spent an afternoon with sandpaper. The desk looks
      fine. The talk was better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821615
    m_Localized: The family of {name} looked at the desk for some time, then offered
      to buy it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821616
    m_Localized: 'A note has reached your office: {name} has been eating lunch alone
      in the stairwell, and some classmates have made sure of it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821617
    m_Localized: Punish those responsible
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821618
    m_Localized: Sit with the student
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821619
    m_Localized: Call both families
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821620
    m_Localized: The ringleaders lost a month of break. {name} ate in the yard the
      next day, cautiously.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821621
    m_Localized: You sat with {name} on the stairs during lunch. You did not say
      much, and that seemed to help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821622
    m_Localized: Two families met in your office with {name} in mind. It was uncomfortable,
      and it needed to be.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821623
    m_Localized: A week on, {name} has stayed out of trouble. The lesson seems to
      have held.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821624
    m_Localized: A week on, {name} is back in the corridor with a new grievance.
      Punishment did not reach far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821625
    m_Localized: A week on, {name} stopped by your door just to say good morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821626
    m_Localized: A week on, {name} nods politely and has changed nothing. Talking
      was the easy part.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821627
    m_Localized: A week on, the homework of {name} arrives signed and on time. Someone
      at home is watching.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821628
    m_Localized: A week on, things at home are tense, and {name} has brought them
      to school.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821629
    m_Localized: Director's day
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821630
    m_Localized: Morning at the gate with the parents
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821631
    m_Localized: Morning broadcast on kindness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821632
    m_Localized: Morning broadcast on study
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821633
    m_Localized: Morning broadcast on discipline
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821634
    m_Localized: You sat at the back of a lesson by {name}, notebook closed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821635
    m_Localized: New air conditioning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821636
    m_Localized: A cool building forgives a great deal. Softens one parent complaint
      each week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821637
    m_Localized: The new air conditioning is running. Nobody has mentioned the heat,
      which is the highest praise available.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821638
    m_Localized: Proper canteen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821639
    m_Localized: Hot food at fair prices, and steady income every week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821640
    m_Localized: The canteen has opened. The samosa shortage is officially over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821641
    m_Localized: Library
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821642
    m_Localized: Shelves, quiet and a slow, reliable rise in academics.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821643
    m_Localized: The library is open. The first book was borrowed within four minutes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821644
    m_Localized: Science lab
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821645
    m_Localized: Real experiments, and steadily better academics.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821646
    m_Localized: The lab is ready. Please note the location of the fire blanket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821647
    m_Localized: Shaded playground
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821648
    m_Localized: Children come home tired and happy. Parents notice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821649
    m_Localized: The playground is finished. Break now feels shorter to everyone
      but the teachers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821650
    m_Localized: Front garden
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821651
    m_Localized: Passers-by start to talk about the school in a kinder voice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821652
    m_Localized: The garden is planted. Three teachers have told you about it already.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821653
    m_Localized: School buses
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821654
    m_Localized: Families further away can consider you now. More students apply.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821655
    m_Localized: The buses have arrived, freshly painted. The drivers have already
      formed opinions about the car park.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821656
    m_Localized: Training centre
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821657
    m_Localized: Send teachers on courses, right here on the grounds. Two places.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821658
    m_Localized: The training centre is open. The whiteboard is new, and the markers
      still work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821659
    m_Localized: Training centre extension
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821660
    m_Localized: Two more places, so the staff room need not empty all at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821661
    m_Localized: The extension is ready. Four teachers can now be improved at the
      same time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821662
    m_Localized: New wing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821663
    m_Localized: A whole new wing, sixty more seats, and a great deal of dust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821664
    m_Localized: The new wing is finished. Sixty empty chairs are waiting, and the
      paint is nearly dry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821665
    m_Localized: Teaching methods
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821666
    m_Localized: A solid refresher. The teacher comes back with new habits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821667
    m_Localized: The teaching methods course is over, and {name} is back in {subject}
      lessons with fresh ideas.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821668
    m_Localized: Subject mastery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821669
    m_Localized: Deep study of the teacher's own subject. A long absence, a large
      gain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821670
    m_Localized: The subject mastery course is over. {name} now knows more {subject}
      than the textbook does.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821671
    m_Localized: Master teacher programme
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821672
    m_Localized: The hardest course offered. The best results, and a tired teacher
      afterwards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821673
    m_Localized: The master programme is over. {name} is back in {subject}, exhausted
      and formidable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821674
    m_Localized: Staff wellbeing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821675
    m_Localized: Short, cheap and restful. Teaches nothing and repairs a lot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821676
    m_Localized: The wellbeing course is over, and {name} returned to {subject} lessons
      smiling, which alarmed the students.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821677
    m_Localized: Al Fanar School
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821678
    m_Localized: Al Sidra School
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821679
    m_Localized: Al Bidaa School
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821680
    m_Localized: Al Maha School
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821681
    m_Localized: Al Dana School
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821682
    m_Localized: Al Ghaf School
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821683
    m_Localized: Al Shamal School
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821684
    m_Localized: Al Rayyan Gate School
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821685
    m_Localized: Falcon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821686
    m_Localized: Palm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821687
    m_Localized: Dhow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821688
    m_Localized: Lamp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821689
    m_Localized: Crescent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821690
    m_Localized: Book
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821691
    m_Localized: Rigour first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821692
    m_Localized: High standards and good results. Some parents will find it a little
      much.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821693
    m_Localized: Curiosity first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821694
    m_Localized: Teachers love the freedom. Exam marks occasionally pay for it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821695
    m_Localized: Body and mind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821696
    m_Localized: Parents love a school with a team. Lesson time sometimes loses out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821697
    m_Localized: Faith and character
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821698
    m_Localized: Manners, values and the steady trust of families.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821699
    m_Localized: Run a summer camp, {cash} QAR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821700
    m_Localized: The camp filled every room. Teachers who wished for a quiet summer
      are not speaking to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821701
    m_Localized: Host adult evening classes, {cash} QAR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821702
    m_Localized: Grown men squeezed into small desks to learn spreadsheets. They
      paid on time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821703
    m_Localized: Take a bank loan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821704
    m_Localized: The bank agreed quickly, which worried you. Repayments now come
      out every week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821705
    m_Localized: The last repayment has gone through. The bank sent a card. You did
      not frame it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821706
    m_Localized: A new academy has opened two streets away, with a banner taller
      than your building. Parents are asking questions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821707
    m_Localized: Offer scholarships
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821708
    m_Localized: Hold an open day
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821709
    m_Localized: Pay it no attention
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821710
    m_Localized: Your scholarships were the talk of the neighbourhood for a week.
      The banner looked slightly smaller.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821711
    m_Localized: Families toured your classrooms, ate your biscuits and stayed to
      chat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821712
    m_Localized: You kept your eyes on your own school. The banner stayed where it
      was.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821713
    m_Localized: The academy is now offering free tablets and a parent app. Some
      of your families have stopped meeting your eye at the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821714
    m_Localized: Fund more scholarships
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821715
    m_Localized: Open the doors again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821716
    m_Localized: Trust your reputation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821717
    m_Localized: It cost a painful amount. Several families who had packed their
      files unpacked them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821718
    m_Localized: Your old students came back to speak. No tablet has yet managed
      that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821719
    m_Localized: You said nothing and carried on. A few more desks stand empty at
      the back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821720
    m_Localized: Midterm exams begin. The corridors have gone suspiciously tidy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821721
    m_Localized: Midterm exams
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821722
    m_Localized: Ramadan has come. Shorter days, softer voices and a canteen with
      nothing to do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821723
    m_Localized: Ramadan Kareem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821724
    m_Localized: National day. Flags on every window, and a parade that was almost
      in step.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821725
    m_Localized: National day
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821726
    m_Localized: Final exams. Nobody is borrowing a ruler without a very good reason.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821727
    m_Localized: Final exams
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821728
    m_Localized: An inspector from the ministry is at the gate, with a thick file
      and no appointment. You have ten minutes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821729
    m_Localized: Show the best classes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821730
    m_Localized: The inspector saw your finest lessons and wrote for a long time,
      nodding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821731
    m_Localized: The inspector opened one door you had not chosen. The note was brief,
      and it was underlined.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821732
    m_Localized: Hand over the records
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821733
    m_Localized: Every file was in order. The inspector looked almost disappointed,
      then signed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821734
    m_Localized: The records were neat, and the results inside them were not. The
      inspector turned each page slowly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821735
    m_Localized: Tell the whole truth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821736
    m_Localized: You listed your own weaknesses before being asked. The inspector
      closed the file and asked for tea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821737
    m_Localized: You were honest, and the inspector was grateful, and wrote down
      all of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821738
    m_Localized: The last evening of the year. Chairs in rows, gowns slightly too
      long, and every parent holding a phone up. They are waiting for you to speak.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821739
    m_Localized: Thank the teachers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821740
    m_Localized: You read the name of every teacher and the room stood up. A few
      of them pretended to have something in their eye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821741
    m_Localized: Speak of their futures
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821742
    m_Localized: You told them the world was smaller than it looks and theirs to
      cross. Several parents wrote that down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821743
    m_Localized: Speak of duty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821744
    m_Localized: You asked them to come back one day and leave this city better.
      The hall went quiet, and stayed that way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821745
    m_Localized: 'City rank: {rank} of 10'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264899821746
    m_Localized: Today's goal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821747
    m_Localized: Keep every teacher in a decent mood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821748
    m_Localized: Get the parents on your side
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821749
    m_Localized: Earn something tonight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821750
    m_Localized: Greet the parents at the gate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821751
    m_Localized: Sit in on a lesson
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821752
    m_Localized: Goal met. A small bonus has found its way to the accounts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821753
    m_Localized: Achievements
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821754
    m_Localized: Nobody left
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821755
    m_Localized: Finish the year without dismissing a single teacher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821756
    m_Localized: Full house
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821757
    m_Localized: Fill every seat in the school.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821758
    m_Localized: Under construction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821759
    m_Localized: Complete your first building project.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821760
    m_Localized: Staff college
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821761
    m_Localized: Send five teachers through a course.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821762
    m_Localized: Best in the city
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821763
    m_Localized: Reach first place in the city ranking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821764
    m_Localized: Seven mornings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821765
    m_Localized: Read the morning letter seven days in a row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821766
    m_Localized: Memories
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821767
    m_Localized: School
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821768
    m_Localized: People
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264899821769
    m_Localized: Build
    m_Metadata:
