      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 504264904015884
    m_Localized: Extend today
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015885
    m_Localized: Shorten today
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015886
    m_Localized: Your school's identity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015887
    m_Localized: School name
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015888
    m_Localized: Crest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015889
    m_Localized: Colour
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015890
    m_Localized: Philosophy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015891
    m_Localized: Minutes per lesson
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015892
    m_Localized: Minutes of break
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015893
    m_Localized: Students to watch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015894
    m_Localized: Marks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015895
    m_Localized: Conduct
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015896
    m_Localized: That teacher is away on a course.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015897
    m_Localized: That candidate is not available.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015898
    m_Localized: A building project is already under way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015899
    m_Localized: That has already been built.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015900
    m_Localized: An earlier project must be finished first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015901
    m_Localized: There are no free places on courses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015902
    m_Localized: This needs a training centre.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015903
    m_Localized: You are still repaying a loan.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015904
    m_Localized: You have already done that today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015905
    m_Localized: Deal with the matter on your desk first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015906
    m_Localized: The school cannot run without a teacher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 504264904015907
    m_Localized: The school day cannot change any further.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 505616996630528
    m_Localized: Pause
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 505617084710912
    m_Localized: Slow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 505617084710913
    m_Localized: Normal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 505617084710914
    m_Localized: Fast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 505617084710915
    m_Localized: Very fast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962787848192
    m_Localized: The maintenance office has been making a noise nobody has reported
      yet. Tomorrow someone will.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962896900096
    m_Localized: Tomorrow the parents' group will have an opinion. Nobody knows about
      what. Neither do they.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962896900097
    m_Localized: Somebody left an envelope with the gate guard. He says he will give
      it to you in the morning, after his tea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962896900098
    m_Localized: The staff room went quiet when you walked past it today. Enjoy the
      mystery overnight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962896900099
    m_Localized: The photocopier has held out for a whole week. It cannot last.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962896900100
    m_Localized: A parent has asked for 'five minutes' tomorrow. Clear the morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962896900101
    m_Localized: Grade 7 were polite to a teacher today. Find out why before they
      do it again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962896900102
    m_Localized: The canteen is trying something new tomorrow. It has a name but
      no one will say what is in it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962896900103
    m_Localized: Your accountant asked if you will be in early. She asked it very
      gently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962896900104
    m_Localized: Tomorrow's timetable looks perfect. That has never once been a good
      sign.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962896900105
    m_Localized: Someone has been asking about your school at the barber's. Word
      travels at the speed of a fade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094400
    m_Localized: Tomorrow morning the bell will ring whether you are ready or not.
      It has never asked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094401
    m_Localized: Monthly certificate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094402
    m_Localized: Compared with last month
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094403
    m_Localized: Twenty school days, signed and stamped. Nobody asked for this certificate,
      and you will still keep it in a drawer forever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094404
    m_Localized: A new star
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094405
    m_Localized: '{stars} stars. The sign painter has already sent his quote.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962901094406
    m_Localized: Achievement earned
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094407
    m_Localized: Career level up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094408
    m_Localized: Level {level}. Directors you once envied now ask how you did it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962901094409
    m_Localized: Finished overnight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094410
    m_Localized: A promotion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094411
    m_Localized: A title of your own
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094412
    m_Localized: The One Who Asked
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094413
    m_Localized: You knew whose father was ill and whose bus was late, and you did
      something about both.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094414
    m_Localized: Keeper of the Ledger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094415
    m_Localized: The accounts balanced. The accountant wept. Nobody else noticed,
      which is the point.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094416
    m_Localized: Nobody Went Home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094417
    m_Localized: A full year without dismissing one member of staff, including that
      one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094418
    m_Localized: Excellent on Paper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094419
    m_Localized: The numbers were magnificent. Reality has asked for a copy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094420
    m_Localized: The Iron Corridor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094421
    m_Localized: Children stopped running when they heard your shoes. So did some
      teachers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094422
    m_Localized: The Reformer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094423
    m_Localized: You changed the way this school teaches, and only half the staff
      still complain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094424
    m_Localized: Beloved of the Group Chat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094425
    m_Localized: Parents said thank you without being asked. Historians doubt it
      happened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094426
    m_Localized: It Was Handled
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094427
    m_Localized: Certain marks moved. Certain files did not. Nobody can prove anything,
      and you know it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094428
    m_Localized: The Gambler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094429
    m_Localized: Your cash went to the edge and looked over several times. It enjoyed
      the view less than you did.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094430
    m_Localized: The Builder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094431
    m_Localized: Dust followed you everywhere this year. The school is bigger, and
      so is the dust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094432
    m_Localized: Maker of Teachers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094433
    m_Localized: Teachers came to you ordinary and left you insufferably good at
      their jobs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094434
    m_Localized: Still Standing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094435
    m_Localized: There was no reason to expect the doors to open in June. They opened
      in June.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094436
    m_Localized: Um Saud 3B
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094437
    m_Localized: Abu Faisal (New Number)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094438
    m_Localized: Um Hamad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094439
    m_Localized: Abu Rashid Parking
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094440
    m_Localized: Mum of Dana G5
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094441
    m_Localized: Abu Salem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094442
    m_Localized: Um Jassim 2nd Phone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094443
    m_Localized: Dr. Hessa (Parent)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094444
    m_Localized: Abu Nasser Office
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094445
    m_Localized: Um Mubarak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094446
    m_Localized: Grandfather of Ali
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094447
    m_Localized: Um Reem Class Rep
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094448
    m_Localized: Fees went up?? Did the teachers also go up, or only the fees
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094449
    m_Localized: '[Voice note, 4:12. Mostly a car indicator. The word ''fees'' appears
      eleven times.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094450
    m_Localized: For this money I expect the school to come to my house and teach
      them there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094451
    m_Localized: May Allah bless the director and open the director's heart and lower
      the fees. Ameen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094452
    m_Localized: Sorry just saw this. Which fees? Is this about the trip in October?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094453
    m_Localized: I added it up. For the same money the kids could go to school in
      Switzerland, with cheese.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094454
    m_Localized: My brother pays less and his school has a pool. It also has no teachers
      but it has a pool.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094455
    m_Localized: Is there a discount for the third child? Asking as a person with
      three children and no hair left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094456
    m_Localized: Everyone please stop complaining here. Complain in the other group,
      the one the Class Rep is not in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094457
    m_Localized: Sorry just saw this. Yes, very high. Also does anyone know the Wi-Fi
      at the gate?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094458
    m_Localized: The bell was late AGAIN. I was on time for the first time since
      2019 and nobody saw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094459
    m_Localized: Please inform the school there is a clock in every phone now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094460
    m_Localized: My youngest says the bell is 'resting'. Who is teaching them these
      words.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094461
    m_Localized: If bell is late can I also be late. Honest question. I have a meeting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094462
    m_Localized: Sorry just saw this. What time is pickup today? Yesterday's today,
      I mean.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094463
    m_Localized: My child came home and fell asleep with the shoes on and the bag
      on. Is this education or the army.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094464
    m_Localized: They are in school longer than I am at work. In fairness, they also
      do more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094465
    m_Localized: '[Voice note, 0:03. Only a very long sigh.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094466
    m_Localized: Long day is good. Please make it longer. Please. I am begging. They
      are at home on Friday and it is a lot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094467
    m_Localized: Sorry just saw this. Is tomorrow a holiday? My wife says no but
      she has been wrong before. She is reading this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094468
    m_Localized: Mashallah beautiful event, may Allah protect the children and whoever
      organised the chairs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094469
    m_Localized: I filmed the whole thing. Forty minutes. Mostly the back of Abu
      Nasser's head. Will share.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094470
    m_Localized: I cried. My husband says it was the dust. It was not the dust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094471
    m_Localized: Very nice, but who parked behind me. White car. Everyone knows which
      white car.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094472
    m_Localized: Sorry just saw this. There was an event? Was mine in it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094473
    m_Localized: Two hours in the sun and the microphone worked for one word. The
      word was 'testing'.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094474
    m_Localized: My child was a tree. Third row. Nobody could see the tree. Three
      weeks we rehearsed that tree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094475
    m_Localized: 'With respect, and I say this with all respect, and I want it noted
      that it is with respect: what was that.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094476
    m_Localized: May Allah forgive whoever chose the juice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094477
    m_Localized: Sorry just saw this. Is it finished? I am at the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094478
    m_Localized: Mashallah new building work at the school. Will there be parking
      in it. Please say parking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094479
    m_Localized: I see the improvements. I also see where my fees went. They look
      nice. They have tiles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094480
    m_Localized: May Allah bless this school and increase it, and increase the shade
      near the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094481
    m_Localized: They have painted everything. I leaned on a wall. Please do not
      ask about my abaya.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094482
    m_Localized: Sorry just saw this. Is that why the road was closed last month?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094483
    m_Localized: 'Good morning to all. [Picture of a rose and a cup of coffee, forwarded
      many times.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094484
    m_Localized: Has anyone seen a small blue lunchbox? It has been missing since
      last term. It should be found soon, or buried.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094485
    m_Localized: Where do we park tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094486
    m_Localized: Wrong group, sorry. Please ignore the message about my sister-in-law.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094487
    m_Localized: Sorry just saw this. Thank you. Thank you for what, please?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094488
    m_Localized: Where do we park tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094489
    m_Localized: 'To the person blocking the gate: I know your car. I know your children.
      I know their marks.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094490
    m_Localized: Same question as yesterday, is there parking near the side gate?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094491
    m_Localized: Abu Rashid has asked about parking for 14 months. Abu Rashid, the
      answer is no. It has always been no. We love you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094492
    m_Localized: Sorry just saw this. Yes I can move my car. Which day was this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094493
    m_Localized: Does anyone have the Science revision sheet? Asking on behalf of
      my child, who says there is no revision sheet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094494
    m_Localized: Exam is on chapters 3 to 7. No, 3 to 6. No. The child is now crying.
      It is 3 to 7.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094495
    m_Localized: May Allah make it easy on them, and on us, because I do not understand
      this maths at all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094496
    m_Localized: We have stopped all screens at home for exams. Day one. I already
      want to transfer schools.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094497
    m_Localized: Sorry just saw this. Exams are when?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094498
    m_Localized: Ramadan Kareem to all. Please confirm the new timings before I fall
      asleep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094499
    m_Localized: Kindly no homework in Ramadan. Nor after Ramadan. May Allah accept.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094500
    m_Localized: 'To the parent who sounded the horn at 7 a.m. while we are all fasting:
      Allah sees you, and so does the guard.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094501
    m_Localized: '[Voice note, 2:40. Recipe for harees. Clearly meant for another
      group. Nobody tells her because it is excellent.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094502
    m_Localized: Sorry just saw this. Eid already? Ramadan Kareem.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094503
    m_Localized: The other school gave every student a tablet. I am not saying anything.
      I am only saying tablet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094504
    m_Localized: Their brochure has a drone photo. Ours has Mr. Hassan pointing at
      a board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094505
    m_Localized: I went for a visit there. Only a visit. They have a coffee machine
      for parents. Only saying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094506
    m_Localized: 'Whoever is thinking of moving: that school''s parents'' group has
      800 messages a day and the car park is worse.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094507
    m_Localized: Sorry just saw this. Which school is better? Decide quickly, I have
      to register by Sunday. Which Sunday I do not know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094508
    m_Localized: My child's marks came home. They did not come home alone. A note
      came with them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094509
    m_Localized: Forty out of a hundred and the teacher wrote 'Keep it up'. Keep
      WHAT up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094510
    m_Localized: With my own money I got a tutor for the tutor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094511
    m_Localized: Is it only me or is everyone's child suddenly having a difficult
      year. Please say everyone's.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094512
    m_Localized: Sorry just saw this. There were marks? He told me the school does
      not give marks this year.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094513
    m_Localized: Mashallah the results. May Allah protect them from the evil eye
      and from their cousins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094514
    m_Localized: Full marks! Who is this child and where have they put mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094515
    m_Localized: 'I am not one to boast. [Attachment: certificate. Attachment: certificate,
      closer. Attachment: certificate, with grandmother.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094516
    m_Localized: Thanks to the teachers. And to me, who stayed up. Mostly to me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094517
    m_Localized: Sorry just saw this. Mabrook to everyone! Who passed?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094518
    m_Localized: Did everyone get the letter? Mine was folded inside a sandwich box.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094519
    m_Localized: I read the letter three times. Could someone with a law degree say
      whether we are in trouble.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094520
    m_Localized: Thank you for the letter. In future a WhatsApp is enough. In future
      a shorter WhatsApp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094521
    m_Localized: The letter says 'dear parents'. It is the kindest anyone has been
      to me this week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094522
    m_Localized: Sorry just saw this. What letter? Is this the one from last year?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094523
    m_Localized: Ministry car at the gate. Repeat, Ministry car at the gate. Everyone
      act educated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094524
    m_Localized: Why are the corridors suddenly smelling of oud and all the teachers
      wearing their good shoes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094525
    m_Localized: My child says an important man asked what they learned and the class
      said 'a lot' all together. Rehearsed?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094526
    m_Localized: If the inspectors need to talk to a parent I am free. I have prepared
      some notes. Eleven pages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094527
    m_Localized: Sorry just saw this. Ask the Ministry about the parking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094528
    m_Localized: Parents' group
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094529
    m_Localized: Staff room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094530
    m_Localized: Silence. Enjoy it, and do not ask how long it will last.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094531
    m_Localized: Does anyone remember why we chose this. I wrote it down once, but
      I marked over it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094532
    m_Localized: I told Grade 8 I was disappointed. They asked if that was on the
      test.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094533
    m_Localized: I sat in my car for twenty minutes before coming in. It is the best
      room in the school.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094534
    m_Localized: My tea has gone cold four times today. I have stopped taking it
      personally. I have not.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962901094535
    m_Localized: Is it Thursday? Please, somebody, say it is Thursday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288704
    m_Localized: The course was excellent. I have forty slides and one idea and I
      am keeping the idea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288705
    m_Localized: They taught us 'active listening'. Nobody has listened to me describe
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288706
    m_Localized: Back from training. I have a certificate, a lanyard and a new fear
      of group work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288707
    m_Localized: Who covered my classes while I was away? Whoever you are, why do
      they now know the words to a song.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288708
    m_Localized: We did an icebreaker for three hours. The ice is still there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288709
    m_Localized: '{name}''s mug is still on the shelf. Nobody will move it. Nobody
      will wash it, either.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288710
    m_Localized: So that is {name} gone. Who has the key to the science cupboard?
      Oh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288711
    m_Localized: Nobody said goodbye properly to {name}. I bought a cake anyway.
      We ate it very quietly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288712
    m_Localized: We are all very calm about {name}. I have updated my CV out of calm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288713
    m_Localized: '{name} left the good stapler. There is a lesson in this. I am taking
      the stapler.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288714
    m_Localized: Did you see {name}'s class today? Silence, and not even the frightened
      kind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288715
    m_Localized: A parent thanked {name} in person. We have asked for the details.
      We need to study this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288716
    m_Localized: A student told me {name} made fractions make sense. I have been
      here nineteen years and I am furious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288717
    m_Localized: 'I will admit it once and I will deny it later: {name} is good.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288718
    m_Localized: '{name} got a note of thanks from the Director. We passed it around.
      It is real.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288719
    m_Localized: I heard {name} has a second job. I heard it is at the rival school.
      I heard it from the canteen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288720
    m_Localized: Why was {name} in the Director's office with the door closed? That
      door has never closed. It sticks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288721
    m_Localized: '{name} is getting engaged, or moving to Muscat, or both. My source
      is reliable. My source is in Grade 6.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288722
    m_Localized: Someone has been using {name}'s milk. There will be consequences.
      There is a label now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288723
    m_Localized: They say {name} once corrected the Ministry inspector's grammar.
      They say the inspector thanked {name}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288724
    m_Localized: It got dark and the guard locked me in. I marked another nine papers
      before I called him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288725
    m_Localized: My children have asked for my photograph so they can recognise me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288726
    m_Localized: We are all here very late. Is this a staff meeting or have we simply
      stopped leaving?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288727
    m_Localized: I have eaten dinner from the vending machine. I chose the crisps
      with vegetables on the packet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288728
    m_Localized: I said 'see you tomorrow' to the cleaner and he said 'it is tomorrow'.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288729
    m_Localized: '{name} has booked the projector until June. In pen.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288730
    m_Localized: I am very happy for {name}'s results. I have calculated them again,
      out of happiness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288731
    m_Localized: '{name} moved my chair. Two centimetres. I measured. I know what
      this means.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288732
    m_Localized: Grade 9 say {name} is their favourite. Grade 9 will have a quiz
      tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288733
    m_Localized: '{name} said good morning to me today in a tone. I replied in a
      tone.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288734
    m_Localized: Congratulations to {name}. Will you still sit with us or is there
      a different kettle now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288735
    m_Localized: So {name} is senior now. I would like it known I taught {name} where
      the photocopier is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288736
    m_Localized: '{name} deserved it. I am saying so loudly, in case the Director
      is near the door.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288737
    m_Localized: '{name} has a new title and the same chair. That is the most honest
      thing about this school.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288738
    m_Localized: Already {name} has used the phrase 'going forward'. It has begun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288739
    m_Localized: 'An envelope arrived with no name, holding every riyal of a debt
      you forgave last term, and a note: ''It took a while. Thank you for not asking.'''
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288740
    m_Localized: The debt came home on its own. You read the note twice and put it
      where the receipts do not go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288741
    m_Localized: The family you made room for has been talking. Two more families
      phoned today to ask whether it is true what they heard about your school.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288742
    m_Localized: It was true. You said so, and the ramp outside was busier this week
      than it has ever been.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288743
    m_Localized: A teacher compared the mark book with the certificate. The two documents
      disagree, and the teacher has brought both of them to your door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288744
    m_Localized: The changed mark has found its way out. People say nothing to your
      face, and they are quite careful about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288745
    m_Localized: The thing you covered up has uncovered itself. A classmate told
      a cousin, who told the whole of Friday lunch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288746
    m_Localized: Everyone now knows who cheated and who looked away. Only one of
      those was a child.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288747
    m_Localized: The leaked paper has surfaced again, with screenshots and dates.
      Your silence is mentioned, by name, in the forwarded version.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288748
    m_Localized: It turned out silence was the one thing that could be forwarded.
      Your phone did not stop until Isha.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288749
    m_Localized: The counsellor brought a drawing to your office, by the child in
      that video. It is of the yard. Everyone in it is standing up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288750
    m_Localized: The drawing is pinned behind your desk now, where you can see it
      and visitors cannot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288751
    m_Localized: 'Your best teacher was offered more money again. The answer was
      given before the sentence ended: ''They looked after me when it counted.'''
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288752
    m_Localized: The raise you once gave has been paying you back ever since. It
      came in again today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288753
    m_Localized: The student you sent away over money was seen at the rival school's
      open day, on stage, with a microphone, talking about what happened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288754
    m_Localized: It was quite a good speech. Several of your parents have watched
      it. Several have watched it twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288755
    m_Localized: The donor whose name you accepted has rung. There is a nephew who
      needs a job, and a hall that needs a larger plaque.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288756
    m_Localized: Generosity, it turns out, has a payment schedule. The plaque is
      being measured.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288757
    m_Localized: The month you borrowed to pay salaries on time has come up in the
      staff room. Nobody has forgotten which director did that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288758
    m_Localized: When you came in this morning, somebody had already made your tea.
      It was terrible, and you drank all of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288759
    m_Localized: Conscience
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288760
    m_Localized: Clear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288761
    m_Localized: Uneasy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288762
    m_Localized: Heavy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288763
    m_Localized: A journalist has phoned. She has dates, documents and an unsettlingly
      calm voice, and she would like a comment by this evening about what has been
      happening in your school.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288764
    m_Localized: Tell her everything
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288765
    m_Localized: Deny it all
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288766
    m_Localized: You told her. The story ran. It was the worst week of your career,
      and for the first time in months you slept.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288767
    m_Localized: You denied it in a steady voice. She thanked you, and said she had
      thought you might.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288768
    m_Localized: You can walk past any parent in any supermarket in this city. It
      sounds like a small thing. Ask a director who cannot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288769
    m_Localized: There are a few files you would rather not reopen. Most nights you
      do not think of them. Most.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288770
    m_Localized: The school survived. You kept everything you set out to keep. You
      have started taking the long way round the old filing cabinet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288771
    m_Localized: Choose your school
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288772
    m_Localized: A New Licence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288773
    m_Localized: A fresh start with fair winds. Nothing is broken yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288774
    m_Localized: The licence is framed, the paint is drying, and no one has complained
      so far. Note the time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288775
    m_Localized: The Rescue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288776
    m_Localized: A school with a bad name, a thin bank account and an old debt due
      every week. Pays extra career XP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288777
    m_Localized: The last director left in a hurry and took the good chairs. The
      debt collector has already introduced himself, warmly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288778
    m_Localized: The Village School
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288779
    m_Localized: One old villa, forty seats, low fees and families who already know
      you. There are not many of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288780
    m_Localized: Everybody in the village has heard you are here. By noon they will
      have heard what you had for breakfast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288781
    m_Localized: The Girls' School
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288782
    m_Localized: Parents start out kinder and watch every riyal more closely. The
      sports philosophy is unavailable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288783
    m_Localized: The mothers have inspected the gate, the curtains and the bus driver.
      You have passed, provisionally.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288784
    m_Localized: The International School
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288785
    m_Localized: High fees, expensive staff and families who will only come if the
      Academics are real.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288786
    m_Localized: The brochure says 'world-class'. The world has been told. It would
      now like to see the laboratory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288787
    m_Localized: '{name} phoned at 6:40 to say it will be impossible to come in today.
      The voice was very weak, and the traffic behind it was very strong.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288788
    m_Localized: Ask a colleague to cover
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288789
    m_Localized: Merge two classes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288790
    m_Localized: Pay a substitute
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288791
    m_Localized: A colleague took the lesson of {name} during a free period, and
      has been describing the sacrifice ever since.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288792
    m_Localized: Two classes, one room, and a shortage of chairs. The absence of
      {name} could be heard from the car park.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288793
    m_Localized: The substitute taught the wrong chapter with great confidence. The
      classes of {name} did not suffer, exactly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288794
    m_Localized: Results day. They are good, and they are real, and the teachers
      have started pretending they always expected it. The notice board is waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288795
    m_Localized: Results day. Respectable. Nothing to hide and nothing to frame,
      unless perhaps a few marks were to round themselves upward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288796
    m_Localized: Results day. The sheet in your hand is not good, and the parents'
      group is already typing. A kinder arithmetic is available, if you are willing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288797
    m_Localized: Publish them as they are
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288798
    m_Localized: Round them up a little
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288799
    m_Localized: The real numbers went on the board. You stood next to them for a
      while, as you would with a relative at a wedding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288800
    m_Localized: The numbers looked better on the board. Numbers always do, once
      somebody has helped them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288801
    m_Localized: 'At the top of the sheet: {name}. The family has asked for six copies.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288802
    m_Localized: This week's challenge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288803
    m_Localized: Challenge complete. Somebody left a bonus on your desk and, for
      once, it is not a bill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288804
    m_Localized: Challenge lost. Nobody saw, apart from the entire staff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288805
    m_Localized: Lean Staff Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288806
    m_Localized: Get through the school week without adding to the teaching staff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288807
    m_Localized: Own Money Only
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288808
    m_Localized: Finish the school week without borrowing a riyal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288809
    m_Localized: Smiles in the Staff Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288810
    m_Localized: Keep staff standing high until the end of the school week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288811
    m_Localized: No Empty Chairs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288812
    m_Localized: Finish the school week with the seats full.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288813
    m_Localized: Early Nights
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288814
    m_Localized: Do not run a single tutoring night all school week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288815
    m_Localized: Peace in the Group
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288816
    m_Localized: Keep parent standing high until the end of the school week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288817
    m_Localized: Your own child's school rang. The irony was not lost on the receptionist.
      Maths has been going badly for some time, and you are, apparently, the last
      to know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288818
    m_Localized: Sit down and study together
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288819
    m_Localized: Hire a tutor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288820
    m_Localized: You did long division at the kitchen table until ten. You were wrong
      twice. Nobody at home has let it go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288821
    m_Localized: A tutor now comes on Mondays. You have become one of those parents,
      and you know exactly what they say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288822
    m_Localized: It is your anniversary. You remembered at 4:15 p.m., in a budget
      meeting, and your face did something that the accountant noticed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288823
    m_Localized: Leave now, and buy flowers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288824
    m_Localized: Finish the budget first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288825
    m_Localized: You got home early with flowers from the petrol station. They were
      received as what they were, and it was still a good evening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288826
    m_Localized: The budget balanced. You came home to a plate in the fridge, with
      cling film over it and a very neat label.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288827
    m_Localized: A headhunter rang from Dubai. Twice the salary, a car, an office
      with a window that opens. They do not need an answer until tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288828
    m_Localized: Stay with your school
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288829
    m_Localized: Negotiate with your board
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288830
    m_Localized: You thanked them and said no. Afterwards you looked at your window
      for a while. It does not open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288831
    m_Localized: You mentioned Dubai, once and lightly. The money appeared. So did
      some coolness in the corridors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288832
    m_Localized: Your doctor has read the results and used the word 'stress', then
      the word 'pressure', and then asked you what exactly it is that you do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288833
    m_Localized: Take a few days to rest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288834
    m_Localized: Take the tablets and carry on
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288835
    m_Localized: You rested. On the second day you caught yourself looking at the
      ceiling and thinking about the timetable. Then you stopped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288836
    m_Localized: The tablets are in your desk drawer, next to the confiscated phones.
      You are all in there together now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288837
    m_Localized: Your mother is not well, and she has asked everyone not to tell
      you. Your sister told you at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288838
    m_Localized: Go and stay with her
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288839
    m_Localized: Pay for a nurse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288840
    m_Localized: You sat with her for days. She corrected your posture and asked
      why you looked so thin. She is better now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288841
    m_Localized: The nurse is excellent. Your mother tells her everything, including
      what she thinks about you not being there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288842
    m_Localized: An old friend needs money, again, and promises it is the last time,
      again. He has brought his own cardamom, as a sign of seriousness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288843
    m_Localized: Lend it to him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288844
    m_Localized: Tell him no
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288845
    m_Localized: You lent it. He cried a little and hugged you. The cardamom has
      stayed. So far, it is all that has come back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288846
    m_Localized: You said no as kindly as a person can. He took the cardamom with
      him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288847
    m_Localized: Your own child's marks at your own school are not what anyone would
      like. The teacher has come to ask, very carefully, what you would like to happen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288848
    m_Localized: Mark it like anyone else's
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288849
    m_Localized: Suggest a little kindness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288850
    m_Localized: The mark stood. Dinner at home was quiet. The teacher looked at
      you differently afterwards, and better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288851
    m_Localized: The mark improved. Nobody mentioned it. You will notice how nobody
      mentioned it for quite a long time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288852
    m_Localized: Your family has found a week by the sea, with a very good price
      and no signal. The photographs have been left on your pillow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288853
    m_Localized: Go, and leave the phone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288854
    m_Localized: Next year, inshallah
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288855
    m_Localized: You went. On the third day you stopped checking for a signal. On
      the fourth, you noticed your children have got taller.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288856
    m_Localized: Next year, you said. Your family nodded, in the way that people
      nod at a weather forecast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288857
    m_Localized: You came home to find them waiting at the table, with no food on
      it. 'We would like to know,' somebody said, 'when you are planning to live
      here.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288858
    m_Localized: Promise, and mean it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288859
    m_Localized: Explain about the school
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288860
    m_Localized: You put your phone in the drawer in front of them. It rang. You
      let it. It was the longest minute of the year.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288861
    m_Localized: You explained about the school. It was a very good explanation.
      By the end you were the only one still at the table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288862
    m_Localized: Energy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288863
    m_Localized: Family
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288864
    m_Localized: '{name} is now a head of department, and has already asked about
      the bigger cupboard.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288865
    m_Localized: '{name} is now Deputy Director. The office door has been fixed,
      so it can be closed meaningfully.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288866
    m_Localized: Make head of department
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288867
    m_Localized: Make deputy director
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288868
    m_Localized: 'Teacher of the month: {name}. The photo went up by the office.
      The rest of the staff have seen it. Often.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288869
    m_Localized: Teacher of the month
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288870
    m_Localized: What became of them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288871
    m_Localized: Twelve years later, the name on the door of a clinic in Doha was
      {name}. There is a photo of your school in the waiting room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288872
    m_Localized: '{name} went on to teach. On the first day, in front of a new class,
      the opening words were ones you used to say.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288873
    m_Localized: A bridge in another country was signed off by {name}. The site office
      has a small framed school certificate that nobody is allowed to move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288874
    m_Localized: '{name} works at a bank now, is good at it, and sends a message
      to the old maths teacher every Eid.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288875
    m_Localized: '{name} took over the family shop and runs the accounts without
      a mistake. Your school''s fees are still remembered as an example of robbery,
      fondly.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288876
    m_Localized: '{name} passed, and left, and remembers mostly the canteen. There
      are worse things to have given someone.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288877
    m_Localized: No one could tell you where {name} went. You asked more than once.
      The file has only a forwarding address that no longer forwards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288878
    m_Localized: '{name} left school early and does not talk about it. Years later
      a chance meeting at a petrol station lasted one nod.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288879
    m_Localized: You saw the name {name} on a list you wished had been a different
      list. You sat for a while before starting the day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288880
    m_Localized: '{name} has put a resignation letter on your desk. It is short,
      and very polite, and has been folded and unfolded many times.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288881
    m_Localized: Ask what went wrong
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288882
    m_Localized: Accept it, with thanks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288883
    m_Localized: '{name} talked for an hour. You took notes. Neither of you touched
      the tea.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288884
    m_Localized: You accepted the letter of {name} with thanks. Nothing happened
      next. Nothing is still happening, very loudly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288885
    m_Localized: The staff room has picked sides over the letter from {name}. Two
      teachers have stopped speaking, and a third is speaking far too much.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288886
    m_Localized: Offer better terms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288887
    m_Localized: Call the staff together
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288888
    m_Localized: Your offer reached {name} before lunch and the rest of the staff
      by the end of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288889
    m_Localized: You said it to everyone at once, in one room. It was uncomfortable,
      and at least nobody can claim to have heard a different version.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288890
    m_Localized: It is the last day of the notice. {name} is standing at your door
      with a box of books, waiting to hear what you will say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288891
    m_Localized: Ask one last time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288892
    m_Localized: Wish them well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288893
    m_Localized: You asked. There was a long silence, and then an answer, and the
      matter of {name} is closed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288894
    m_Localized: You shook hands at the door. Grade 6 had made a card for {name},
      and it was spelled nearly correctly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288895
    m_Localized: A father is in reception with a folder. He says his lawyer is a
      close friend. He says it several times, to several people.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288896
    m_Localized: Invite him in for coffee
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288897
    m_Localized: Ask for it in writing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288898
    m_Localized: He drank three cups and described the complaint from its beginnings
      in about 2011. He seemed slightly calmer, and left the folder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288899
    m_Localized: He said you would be hearing from him in writing. You have since
      learned that he types with one finger, and is very committed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288900
    m_Localized: He has taken it to the parents' group. There are screenshots, a
      long voice note, and one very enthusiastic ally who has not understood the
      problem.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288901
    m_Localized: Reply to the group yourself
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288902
    m_Localized: Stay out of the group
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288903
    m_Localized: You wrote four careful sentences. Twenty parents replied with a
      thumbs-up, and one asked where to park.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288904
    m_Localized: You said nothing. The group said it for you, in over three hundred
      messages, until someone posted a rose and a coffee.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288905
    m_Localized: A letter on real legal paper has arrived, and with it a final offer
      from him. It is time for this to end, one way or the other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288906
    m_Localized: Settle it quietly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288907
    m_Localized: Let him take it further
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288908
    m_Localized: It ended with a signature and a very cold handshake. At the gate,
      he asked you about the parking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288909
    m_Localized: You told him the door was open and the law was too. The matter has
      been settled, and the folder has at last gone home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288910
    m_Localized: Director
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288911
    m_Localized: Your career
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288912
    m_Localized: Level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288913
    m_Localized: Experience
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288914
    m_Localized: To next level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288915
    m_Localized: Hall of fame
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288916
    m_Localized: No names on the wall yet. Finish a year and hang one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288917
    m_Localized: Same again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288918
    m_Localized: End of the day
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288919
    m_Localized: Cash today
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288920
    m_Localized: Best moment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288921
    m_Localized: Tomorrow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288922
    m_Localized: Nothing happened. Write that down; it is rare.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288923
    m_Localized: School rating
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288924
    m_Localized: Timetable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288925
    m_Localized: Morning lessons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288926
    m_Localized: Pick three different subjects. Children can think until about eleven.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288927
    m_Localized: Unlocks at level {level}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 16764438439788569
  - m_Id: 517962905288928
    m_Localized: Album
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288929
    m_Localized: Not yet earned
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288930
    m_Localized: Understood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288931
    m_Localized: Your career has not reached that yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288932
    m_Localized: You have nothing left today. Go home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288933
    m_Localized: The morning needs exactly three different subjects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288934
    m_Localized: This teacher is not ready for that role yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288935
    m_Localized: That role is already taken.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288936
    m_Localized: This month already has its teacher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288937
    m_Localized: There is nothing to celebrate at the moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288938
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288939
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517962905288940
